Обострение гастрита - Неверно</strong></span></p><p>Сжимающий характер боли и ишемические изменения на ЭКГ [1, раздел 2.1, стр. 26].</p>"}, "componentName": "ContentText"}, {"id": 3, "componentData": {"buttonsList": [{"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "previous", "internalId": 0, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Назад"}, {"image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "next", "internalId": 0, "checkQuestion": false}, "buttonName": "Далее"}]}, "componentName": "ContentButtons"}]}, "internal_id": 38, "question_text": "", "created_by": "admin", "updated_by": "admin", "created_at": "2026-06-06T10:21:52.178488Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-06T10:21:52.178488Z"}, {"id": 14248, "question_type_id": 2, "is_active": true, "test_id": 1173, "seq_no": 12, "body": {"name": "(4) Выберите необходимые лабораторные исследования", "content": [{"id": 1, "componentData": {"title": "Выберите необходимые лабораторные исследования"}, "componentName": "ContentTitle"}, {"id": 3, "componentData": {"hints": true, "columns": 2, "markers": [], "hintText": "", "multiple": true, "textData": {"text": ""}, "warnings": true, "doShuffle": true, "allCorrect": {"text": "Исследования назначены верно!", "color": "#A3D65C", "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "buttons": [{"action": {"name": "closeModalWarning"}, "buttonName": "Закрыть"}], "showTime": 0}, "imagesData": {"imagesList": [{"label": "", "imageURL": ""}], "imagesWidthPercent": 100}, "totalHints": 2, "answersList": [{"id": 1, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAnswer": false}, "isRight": false, "answerText": "Тропонин I или T (вч) в динамике (0–1 час).", "isRightAlt": false, "notRequired": false}, {"id": 2, "image": {"label": "", "imageURL": ""}, "action": {"name": "moveToStep", "doAction": false, "internalId": 0, "clickAction": false, "checkQuestion": false, "trackRepeatAns